{"root":{"data":{"id":"dmkmdlapbnk0","created":1793611964275,"text":"3 卫星运动基础及GPS卫星星历"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmkmevuvjl40","created":1793612065627,"text":"概述"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmkmlczgvv40","created":1793612573095,"text":"卫星的绕地运动受 地球、太阳、月球等天体引力、潮汐引力、太阳光压等力的作用"},"children":[{"data":{"id":"dmkmmqvvx400","created":1793612681718,"text":"如果将地球引力权重置为1，其它力的权重均小于1e-5"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmkmoc0vnbs0","created":1793612806096,"text":"摄动力与中心引力相比仅为1e-3"},"children":[]}]},{"data":{"id":"dmkmdvfnddc0","created":1793611986342,"text":"卫星的无摄运动"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmkmemhvac00","created":1793612045250,"text":"卫星的受摄运动"},"children":[]},{"data":{"id":"dmkmeyblrpk0","created":1793612070992,"text":"GPS卫星星历"},"children":[]}]},"template":"right","theme":"fresh-blue-compat","version":"1.4.43"}